%% Citizen Status Timeline — Interaction
%% Page: docs/D-UX-Design/citizen-status-timeline.md
%% Anjali (anchor, T1 default) on mobile. Reads from chain events filtered to CitizenVisibleEventType.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Anjali as Anjali (citizen, mobile)
    participant Page as CitizenStatusTimeline
    participant Hook as useIncidentTimeline(id)
    participant Filter as CitizenVisibleEventType
    participant API as GET /api/chain/blocks?from=…&to=…
    participant Action as ActionCall component
    participant Toast as ToastProvider

    Anjali->>Page: Tap report in /my-reports
    Page->>Hook: load timeline
    Hook->>API: GET /api/chain/blocks
    API-->>Hook: events[]
    Hook->>Filter: keep only CitizenVisibleEventType
    Filter-->>Hook: visible[]
    Hook-->>Page: state (loading | ready | empty)
    Page->>Anjali: summary card + timeline list (newest first, Bangla)

    alt Journey A — in-flight check (latest = ReportReceived)
        Page->>Action: render "In-progress reassurance"
        Action-->>Anjali: read-only message + "Open My reports"
    else Journey B — after a day (latest = FieldVisitScheduled)
        Page->>Action: render "In-progress reassurance"
    else Journey C — closure-tap (latest = IncidentResolved,<br/>30-day window open)
        Page->>Action: render "Closure ack"<br/>Primary: Mark as read
        Anjali->>Action: Tap Mark as read
        Action->>API: POST /api/events { kind: CitizenAcknowledged }
        API-->>Action: 201
        Action->>Toast: success "Acknowledged"
        Action->>Page: re-render → "All caught up"
    else Journey D — silent-closure (>30 days since resolved,<br/>no ack)
        Page->>Action: render "Silent-closure reopen"<br/>Primary: Reopen + optional reason (5–280 chars)
        Anjali->>Action: Tap Reopen
        Action->>API: POST /api/events { kind: ReopenRequest,<br/>reason? }
        API-->>Action: 201
        Action->>Toast: success "Reopened"
        Action->>Page: re-render → "In-progress reassurance"
    end

    alt Locale toggle
        Anjali->>Page: Tap EN/BN toggle
        Page->>Anjali: re-render in selected locale (idb persist)
    end

    Note over Page,Filter: Public mode hides hash, seq, payload,<br/>reporter_id internals. Only motion + status.<br/>Quiet-for-X-days note appears after 24h of no events.
